items/ex-intervals-and-euclidean-spaces-are-contractible.md:39:[L1] Every nonempty convex subset of $\mathbb R^m$ with $m\ge1$ is contractible to any chosen point by straight lines ([[cor-convex-subsets-of-rn-are-contractible]]).
