research/audit/wave6-dispatch/audit-beta-topology.log-74495-+  compactness of the codomain suffices for closed graph to imply continuity;
research/audit/wave6-dispatch/audit-beta-topology.log-74496-+  Hausdorffness is needed for the converse. The stated two directions and the
research/audit/wave6-dispatch/audit-beta-topology.log-74497-+  proofs use those hypotheses correctly.
