research/audit/wave6-dispatch/audit-beta-topology.log-74499-+  "every map out of $X$ is nullhomotopic" is equivalent to the usual
research/audit/wave6-dispatch/audit-beta-topology.log-74500-+  identity-nullhomotopic definition. The ledger records this as a convention
research/audit/wave6-dispatch/audit-beta-topology.log-74501-+  delta, not a new theorem.
